      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/LinkDotNet.StringBuilder.FixedSizeValueStringBuilder.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">A string builder backed by a fixed-size, caller-supplied buffer which never grows and never rents a replacement\nbuffer. Formatting arbitrary custom values and converting nonempty content to a <xref href=\"System.String\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> can still\nallocate on the heap.</p>\n"
